  {
   "entity": "quest",
   "slot": "create",
   "srcId": "sg509_fire",
   "phase": 2,
   "name": "At the Salvager's Fire",
   "data": {
    "name": "At the Salvager's Fire",
    "description": "The salvager's fire still burns below the Wreck. Sit with her any time and ask about getting aboard, the charts, the deep, the Haul, the shards, trading or the watch log.",
    "image": "https://uploadthing.b-cdn.net/f/630cf6e7-c152-4dea-a3ff-821de76d7f5a_default.webp",
    "questType": "event",
    "questRank": "D",
    "successDescription": "The fire's there when you need it.",
    "retryDelay": "none",
    "attemptDelay": "none",
    "consecutiveObjectives": true,
    "hidden": true,
    "requiredLevel": 1,
    "maxLevel": 100,
    "maxAttempts": 100,
    "maxCompletes": 100,
    "prerequisiteQuestId": null,
    "tierLevel": null,
    "requiredVillage": null,
    "requiredBloodlineId": null,
    "startsAt": null,
    "endsAt": null,
    "content": {
     "objectives": [
      {
       "id": "d_open",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "The Ghost Ship hung over this coast longer than anyone's grandmother could remember. Three nights ago she came down.<br><br>A salvager mends a net by a driftwood fire below the wreck. \"Another one come to pick her bones. Sit, then. Ask.\"",
       "sceneBackground": "rX78pJPETsUL2JrsSvGHn",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Sit by the fire",
         "nextObjectiveId": "d_menu"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "d_menu",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "She nods at a board of driftwood where she pins what the sea gives back. \"Ask what you came to ask.\"<br><br><i>Pick a topic. You can come back to this board after each answer.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_menu",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "How do I get aboard her?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "a_threes"
        },
        {
         "text": "What are these charts?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "c_once"
        },
        {
         "text": "What's down in the deep?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "p_seals"
        },
        {
         "text": "What are ledger pages?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "h_haul"
        },
        {
         "text": "What are the shards for?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "s_four"
        },
        {
         "text": "Can I trade what I find?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "t_trade"
        },
        {
         "text": "What's the watch log?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "w_board"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "a_threes",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Nobody goes aboard alone and comes back. Go in threes.\"<br><br><i>The Wreck is a party dungeon in sector 210. It takes exactly 3 players, and a run lasts up to an hour.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_threes",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Which part of her?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "a_hulls"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "a_hulls",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"She broke in two. The near half is faded and gentler. The far half still remembers every order.\"<br><br><i>The Faded Skyglass Wreck (sector 210, 16/6) is tuned for levels 40 to 60. The Skyglass Wreck (15/6) is the endgame hull, tuned for level 100.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_hulls",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "What comes back out?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "a_loot"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "a_loot",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Coin, stores and paper. <b>Charts</b>, wet ones, drawn by the crew themselves.\"<br><br><i>Every clear pays ryo and EXP and can drop charts. The endgame hull also drops the rarer charts, ledger pages, the Lantern and a shard.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_loot",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Ask something else",
         "nextObjectiveId": "r_menu"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "c_once",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Each chart is the way into one corner of her, and she doesn't hold still, so it's good once.\"<br><br><i>Take a chart to the <b>Battle Arena</b> and run it alone. The chart is spent when the run starts. Health and chakra carry from fight to fight, and a lost fight ends the run.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_once",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Where do they lead?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "c_ladder"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "c_ladder",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"The low-tide charts and the rosters take you to the lower decks. Down there are the crew's own charts: what they buried, the works, the archive, the helm. Those lead to the places the crew sealed shut.\"<br><br><i>Each run can drop the chart to a deeper one.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_ladder",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "What do I get for winning?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "c_pick"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "c_pick",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Win, and the crew lets you choose what to carry out.\"<br><br><i>A winning ending lets you pick one reward from a short list and pays EXP. Nothing is paid for a lost run. Every chart shows its difficulty in stars.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_pick",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Ask something else",
         "nextObjectiveId": "r_menu"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "p_seals",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Some doors the crew sealed. The Reliquary Seal opens the reliquary. The Last Heading takes you back to the night she fell.\"<br><br><i>These are the Epic runs, The Sealed Reliquary and The Fall. Their charts drop from the Archive and the Captain's Watch.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_seals",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "And the rot?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "p_rot"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "p_rot",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Soak a sealed chart in <b>Core Rot</b> and the rot remembers the place worse.\"<br><br><i>Use an Epic chart with 3 Core Rot to steep it, then win one fight. You get the tainted chart: a harder run where you pick 2 rewards. Lose, and the chart comes back but the Rot is spent.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_rot",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "And past that?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "p_lantern"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "p_lantern",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Some come back from the deep with a <b>lantern</b> that won't go out. It points at the mountain, at <b>Crownhold</b>, the castle she sailed from. Someone still gives orders there.\"<br><br><i>A Lastlight Lantern opens Crownhold. It drops from the Epic and tainted runs, and rarely from the endgame Wreck.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_lantern",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Ask something else",
         "nextObjectiveId": "r_menu"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "h_haul",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Others come back with a ledger page or a stores list, and go looking for holds no chart shows. They come back heavy, or not at all.\"<br><br><i>A page opens The Haul: up to 5 steps where you choose a crate, a locker, to cut through, or to leave. The deeper you go, the bigger the chests of profession materials. A lost fight ends the run.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_haul",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Ask something else",
         "nextObjectiveId": "r_menu"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "s_four",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Four of them brought me <b>shards</b>. Different hands, same glass. Lay them side by side and they ring.\"<br><br><i>Keel: the endgame Wreck. Crown: Crownhold. Tide: the Epic and tainted runs. Ledger: The Haul.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_shards",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "What do they open?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "s_below"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "s_below",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"Under Crownhold the stair stops where the rock does. I've stood at the bottom. Something beneath it listens back.\"<br><br><i>One of each shard opens the last fight, below Crownhold. You go alone, all four are spent when it starts, and a loss pays nothing.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_below",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Ask something else",
         "nextObjectiveId": "r_menu"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "t_trade",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"What you can't use, trade. Every chart and every shard has a buyer, so no road's ever closed for good.\"<br><br><i>Charts, Core Rot, ledger pages, shards and Skyglass Tokens can be traded. Crown's Hoard and a few once-only rewards cannot.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_trade",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "What's a Skyglass Token?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "t_token"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "t_token",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"The crew's colours still take to steel.\"<br><br><i>A Skyglass Token unlocks any one of the 12 Skyglass skins on a weapon you already own. A boss's own token unlocks that boss's skin.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_token",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Ask something else",
         "nextObjectiveId": "r_menu"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "w_board",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"I keep their <b>watch log</b>. It washes up a page at a time. I dry one each weekend and pin it on the <b>Information Board</b>.\"<br><br><i>A new page goes up each weekend on the Information Board in your village's Administration Building. Take it first: only what you do while you carry it counts.</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_logboard",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "What's on a page?",
         "nextObjectiveId": "w_orders"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "w_orders",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "\"One watch's orders. Lately the name at the top isn't one of theirs.\"<br><br><i>Do the orders in any order and claim each reward from your Logbook. Finish them all for the page's last reward. The page closes Tuesday 00:00 UTC (Monday 6 PM Central).</i>",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_orders",
       "sceneCharacters": [
        "Xugt7415D3-tepLfxpwM5"
       ],
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Ask something else",
         "nextObjectiveId": "r_menu"
        },
        {
         "text": "That's all for now",
         "nextObjectiveId": "z_bye"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "r_menu",
       "task": "reset_quest",
       "description": "Back to the fire.",
       "resetObjectiveId": "d_menu",
       "sceneBackground": "@scene:sg509_board_menu",
